#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvh743pro.rst:43
#: f2a117033493412a821d96261eb90029
msgid "UART Mapping"
msgstr "UART 映射"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvh743pro.rst:44
#: ffcdcca269364956b4ab262c9f90a95f
msgid ""
"The UARTs are marked Rn and Tn in the above pinouts. The Rn pin is the "
"receive pin for UARTn. The Tn pin is the transmit pin for UARTn. * SERIAL0 "
"-> USB * SERIAL1 -> UART1 (GPS) DMA capable * SERIAL2 -> UART2 (MAVLink2) * "
"SERIAL3 -> UART3 (ESC Telemetry) * SERIAL4 -> UART4 (DisplayPort) DMA "
"capable * SERIAL5 -> UART5 (RCin) RX DMA capable * SERIAL6 -> UART6 (User) "
"DMA capable * SERIAL7 -> UART7 (User) DMA Capable * SERIAL8 -> UART8 (User)"
msgstr ""
"上述引脚定义中 UART 标记为 Rn 和 Tn。Rn 为 UARTn 的接收引脚，Tn 为 UARTn 的发送引脚。* SERIAL0 -> USB "
"* SERIAL1 -> UART1（GPS）支持 DMA * SERIAL2 -> UART2（MAVLink2）* SERIAL3 -> "
"UART3（ESC 数传）* SERIAL4 -> UART4（DisplayPort）支持 DMA * SERIAL5 -> UART5（RC "
"输入）RX 支持 DMA * SERIAL6 -> UART6（用户）支持 DMA * SERIAL7 -> UART7（用户）支持 DMA * "
"SERIAL8 -> UART8（用户）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvh743pro.rst:57
#: d0b3a89c0090490db279b17090a4ccc9
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvh743pro.rst:58
#: fc80d8f2701a41239be4eb076f6bcb5c
msgid ""
"RC input is configured by default via the USART5 RX input. It supports all "
"unidirectional serial RC protocols except PPM . The SBUS pin is inverted and"
" tied to R5 for SBUS support."
msgstr ""
"RC 输入默认通过 USART5 RX 引脚配置，支持除 PPM 之外的所有单向串行 RC 协议。SBUS 引脚经过反相后连接到 R5，用于支持 "
"SBUS。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvh743pro.rst:60
#: dc9c5ac7733c46ac96987da6a19d291c
msgid ""
"FPort :ref:`SERIAL5_OPTIONS<SERIAL5_OPTIONS>` set to 4 (half-duplex).  See "
":ref:`common-FPort-receivers`."
msgstr ""
"FPort：将 :ref:`SERIAL5_OPTIONS<SERIAL5_OPTIONS>` 设置为 4（半双工）。参见 :ref:`common-"
"FPort-receivers`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvh743pro.rst:61
#: 7262945d5e3f47c1b4ff13ed54905a13
msgid "CRSF/ELRS uses RX5/TX5."
msgstr "CRSF/ELRS 使用 RX5/TX5。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvh743pro.rst:62
#: c7d152a32e984dd1b5be6804642b2b42
msgid ""
"SRXL2 requires a connection to T5 and automatically provides telemetry.  Set"
" :ref:`SERIAL5_OPTIONS<SERIAL5_OPTIONS>` to \"4\"."
msgstr ""
"SRXL2 需要连接到 T5 并自动提供数传。将 :ref:`SERIAL5_OPTIONS<SERIAL5_OPTIONS>` 设为 「4」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvh743pro.rst:65
#: 85d664e5891448ebb4f484dd3db25527
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr "PWM 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvh743pro.rst:66
#: d07c665560034c72bdedca8fba46a381
msgid ""
"The DAKEFPV H743/Pro supports up to 14 outputs. The pads for motor output M1"
" to M8 are provided on both the motor connectors and on separate pads, plus "
"S1-4, LED on  separate pads for LED strip and other PWM outputs. M1-8, S1, "
"and S2 support B-Directional DShot. OSD, S3-4 support only PWM. The LED "
"output supports serial LED or DShot."
msgstr ""
"DAKEFPV H743/Pro 最多支持 14 路输出。M1 至 M8 的电机输出焊盘同时在电机连接器和独立焊盘上提供，另外还有 S1-4、LED "
"等独立焊盘用于 LED 灯带和其他 PWM 输出。M1-8、S1 和 S2 支持双向 DShot。OSD、S3-4 仅支持 PWM。LED 输出支持串行"
" LED 或 DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvh743pro.rst:70
#: e23abc79d119495da026eb747f137595
msgid ""
"For the H743 Pro the outputs are in 7 groups: * M 1-4     in group1 * M 5,6"
"     in group2 * M 7,8    in group3 * S 1,2    in group4 * S 3,4    in "
"group5 * OSD    in group 6 * LED    in group 7"
msgstr ""
"H743 Pro 的输出分为 7 组：* M 1-4 在第 1 组 * M 5,6 在第 2 组 * M 7,8 在第 3 组 * S 1,2 在第 4"
" 组 * S 3,4 在第 5 组 * OSD 在第 6 组 * LED 在第 7 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvh743pro.rst:79
#: 16b0b544b2c84de2ba235b1dbf4a4c67
msgid ""
"For the H743 the outputs are in 6 groups: * M 1-4     in group1 * M 5-8     "
"in group2 * S 1,2    in group3 * S 3,4    in group4 * OSD    in group 5 * "
"LED    in group 6"
msgstr ""
"H743 的输出分为 6 组：* M 1-4 在第 1 组 * M 5-8 在第 2 组 * S 1,2 在第 3 组 * S 3,4 在第 4 组 *"
" OSD 在第 5 组 * LED 在第 6 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvh743pro.rst:87
#: 218903c6fd754859a013469bd5e7cf28
msgid ""
"Channels within the same group need to use the same output rate. If any "
"channel in a group uses DShot then all channels in the group need to use "
"DShot."
msgstr "同一组内的通道必须使用相同的输出频率。如果某组中任何通道使用 DShot，该组所有通道均需使用 DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvh743pro.rst:92
#: 20a9c8db94264cb5b6c77f413cf0f85b
msgid "Battery Monitoring"
msgstr "电池监测"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvh743pro.rst:93
#: 05d2cce66f07472b9461375f0b8d4d1d
msgid ""
"The board has a built-in voltage sensor and external current sensor input. "
"The current sensor can read up to 130 Amps. The voltage sensor can handle up"
" to 12S LiPo batteries."
msgstr "板载内置电压传感器和外部电流传感器输入，电流传感器最大可读取 130A，电压传感器最高支持 12S 锂电池。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvh743pro.rst:96
#: bf00487a08b24af7befadecdcd3cf65a
msgid ""
"The correct battery setting parameters are: * "
":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` 4 * "
":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 11 * "
":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 10 * "
":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 16.0 * "
":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 83.3"
msgstr ""
"正确的电池设置参数为：* :ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` 4 * "
":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 11 * "
":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 10 * "
":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 16.0 * "
":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 83.3"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvh743pro.rst:104
#: 8c2543c5a7c043c9aafd2c1c76c237bb
msgid "RSSI"
msgstr "RSSI"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvh743pro.rst:105
#: 3c394279124640dd9bbfd46f937c5cf0
msgid ""
"ADC Pin 8 -> Analog RSSI voltage monitoring. Set :ref:`RSSI_TYPE<RSSI_TYPE>`"
" = 1 and :ref:`RSSI_ANA_PIN<RSSI_ANA_PIN>` = 8. For RSSI embedded in digital"
" RC protocols like CRSF, set :ref:`RSSI_TYPE<RSSI_TYPE>` = 3"
msgstr ""
"ADC 引脚 8 -> 模拟 RSSI 电压监测。设置 :ref:`RSSI_TYPE<RSSI_TYPE>` = 1 和 "
":ref:`RSSI_ANA_PIN<RSSI_ANA_PIN>` = 8。对于嵌入数字 RC 协议（如 CRSF）中的 RSSI，设置 "
":ref:`RSSI_TYPE<RSSI_TYPE>` = 3"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvh743pro.rst:108
#: 01fecde54c5246a79b0cd289d4e82f16
msgid "Compass"
msgstr "罗盘"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvh743pro.rst:109
#: 880e8e5ffccf4d368d53ad825cd395ad
msgid ""
"The DAKEFPV H743/Pro does not have a built-in compass, but you can attach an"
" external compass using I2C on the SDA and SCL pads."
msgstr "DAKEFPV H743/Pro 没有内置罗盘，但可以通过 SDA 和 SCL 焊盘上的 I2C 连接外部罗盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvh743pro.rst:112
#: 554a1d4e4a0a446595c9c58aedb8f2dc
msgid "Camera control"
msgstr "相机控制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvh743pro.rst:113
#: a783aa8221ca47ef97c4445a48e833d7
msgid ""
"GPIO 81 controls the camera output to the connectors marked \"CAM1\" and "
"\"CAM2\". Setting this GPIO low switches the video output from CAM1 to CAM2."
" By default RELAY1 is configured to control this pin and sets the GPIO high."
msgstr ""
"GPIO 81 控制标记为「CAM1」和「CAM2」连接器的摄像头输出。将此 GPIO 设为低电平可将视频输出从 CAM1 切换至 "
"CAM2。默认情况下，RELAY1 配置为控制此引脚并将 GPIO 设为高电平。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvh743pro.rst:116
#: 99dcd4db645d4aa89046df3adc28d24b
msgid "VTX Power Control"
msgstr "VTX 电源控制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvh743pro.rst:117
#: 0bfc4755285b4bf991a26f96825e9f13
msgid ""
"GPIO 82 controls the VTX power output to the connectors marked \"12V\". "
"Setting this GPIO low switches the video power off. By default RELAY2 is "
"configured to control this pin and sets the GPIO high."
msgstr ""
"GPIO 82 控制标记为「12V」连接器的 VTX 电源输出。将此 GPIO 设为低电平可关闭视频电源。默认情况下，RELAY2 配置为控制此引脚并将"
" GPIO 设为高电平。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvh743pro.rst:120
#: 43ff0e98786e4270a3f6e10b9609d036
msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr "OSD 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvh743pro.rst:121
#: c99670671f4a4dbcacb27d262bdf08e0
msgid ""
"The DAKEFPVH743/Pro has an onboard OSD using a MAX7456 chip and is enabled "
"by default. The CAM1/2 and VTX pins provide connections for using the "
"internal OSD. Simultaneous DisplayPort OSD is also possible and is "
"configured by default."
msgstr ""
"DAKEFPVH743/Pro 配备基于 MAX7456 芯片的板载 OSD，默认已启用。CAM1/2 和 VTX 引脚提供内置 OSD "
"的连接接口，同时也支持 DisplayPort OSD（默认配置）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvh743pro.rst:123
#: 74719f670b814be48ffd456691f130b7
msgid ""
"The HD VTX connector can have RX4 replaced by the analog VTX signal if that "
"connector is used for analog VTX connection by using the DJI/VTX jumper "
"pads."
msgstr "如通过 DJI/VTX 跳线焊盘将该连接器用于模拟 VTX 连接，HD VTX 连接器上的 RX4 可替换为模拟 VTX 信号。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvh743pro.rst:126
#: ae9aee4d47a7433090fab32c8826844d
msgid "Loading Firmware"
msgstr "加载固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvh743pro.rst:127
#: 5c8390359e6446efa252700ef82e1b8a
msgid ""
"Firmware for the H743 PRO version can be found `here "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`__ in sub-folders labeled "
"\"DAKEFPVH743Pro\"."
msgstr ""
"H743 PRO 版本的固件可在 `此处 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`__ "
"的「DAKEFPVH743Pro」子文件夹中找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvh743pro.rst:129
#: bc5eafac403c4bf48b374413533855aa
msgid ""
"Firmware for the H743 version can be found `here "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`__ in sub-folders labeled \"DAKEFPVH743\"."
msgstr ""
"H743 版本的固件可在 `此处 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`__ 的「DAKEFPVH743」子文件夹中找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvh743pro.rst:131
#: 937f7a7833d446718def960ea9d397cc
msgid ""
"Initial firmware load can be done with DFU by plugging in USB with the "
"bootloader button pressed. Then you should load the \"with_bl.hex\" "
"firmware, using your favourite DFU loading tool."
msgstr ""
"首次固件加载可通过按住引导程序按钮插入 USB 以 DFU 模式进行，然后使用您偏好的 DFU 烧录工具加载「with_bl.hex」固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvh743pro.rst:135
#: a8f0eec2579348139a13662dfb31d55f
msgid ""
"Once the initial firmware is loaded you can update the firmware using any "
"ArduPilot ground station software. Updates should be done with the \\*.apj "
"firmware files."
msgstr "完成首次固件加载后，可使用任意 ArduPilot 地面站软件更新固件，更新时应使用 \\*.apj 固件文件。"
